.411 265.684 968.27C265.684 965.746 266.355 963.531 267.697 961.624C269.067 959.718 270.973 958.228 273.416 957.154C275.86 956.08 278.706 955.543 281.955 955.543C285.15 955.543 287.983 956.106 290.453 957.234C292.95 958.362 294.91 959.96 296.333 962.027C297.783 964.094 298.548 966.565 298.629 969.438H290.493C290.466 967.37 289.688 965.665 288.157 964.323C286.627 962.953 284.6 962.269 282.076 962.269C279.659 962.269 277.739 962.833 276.316 963.96C274.893 965.088 274.182 966.471 274.182 968.109C274.182 969.559 274.719 970.727 275.793 971.613C276.894 972.499 278.397 973.156 280.304 973.586L287.553 975.197C291.715 976.11 294.762 977.52 296.696 979.426C298.656 981.332 299.636 983.83 299.636 986.917C299.636 989.629 298.884 991.965 297.38 993.925C295.904 995.859 293.876 997.362 291.299 998.436C288.721 999.483 285.781 1000.01 282.478 1000.01ZM327.648 956.469V963.477H303V956.469H327.648ZM310.491 944.87H318.989V987.763C318.989 989.32 319.311 990.421 319.956 991.066C320.627 991.683 321.808 991.992 323.5 991.992C324.144 991.992 324.856 991.992 325.635 991.992C326.413 991.992 327.084 991.992 327.648 991.992V999C326.95 999 326.104 999 325.111 999C324.144 999 323.205 999 322.292 999C318.291 999 315.324 998.168 313.391 996.503C311.458 994.811 310.491 992.261 310.491 988.851V944.87Z"
